    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Google Sheets sync\n\nMirrors every application into a spreadsheet you can read on your phone — no SSH, no dashboard.\n\n### Set up once\n\n- Put your Sheet ID in **Sync to Google Sheet** (the tab is gid 0)\n- Header row: `ID, Status, Score, Job Title, Company, Location, Resume Used, Honesty Flag, Why Waiting, Discovered, Submitted, Link`\n- Attach your Google and API-key credentials\n\n### Your Approve? column is safe\n\nThis node writes twelve named columns and nothing else. Add an **Approve?** column to the right of `Link` and type `yes` in it — the sync will never overwrite what you put there.\n\nExplicit column mapping rather than auto-map, so that guarantee is ours rather than a side effect of how n8n happens to treat unmapped columns.\n\n### How it behaves\n\n`appendOrUpdate` matched on **ID**, so re-running updates rows in place rather than appending duplicates. Safe to run as often as you like.\n\nEvery 3 hours, or hit **Execute Workflow** any time.\n\nThe tab is resolved by **gid**, not by name, so renaming the tab will not break the sync.\n\n### Why these columns\n\n`Honesty Flag` is its own column on purpose: an unsupported claim in a cover letter is the one thing worth spotting at a glance before approving anything from a phone.\n\n`Why Waiting` merges review and skip reasons, so scanning down the sheet tells you what needs you and what the agent handled itself.",
        "height": 720,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "296abf35-edd9-4814-86cb-c6dcf2b715ff",
      "name": "Setup notes",
